# file: core/examples/hello/web/.gitignore
# version: 0.1.0
# guid: 2c7f0e94-8b36-4a15-9d2e-6f1a3c8b5e70
# last-edited: 2026-11-20
# The built SPA ui_embed.go embeds; made by `make -C core hello-web`, never committed.
dist/
*.tsbuildinfo
# node_modules is a symlink to ../../../web/node_modules that
# `make -C core web-install` creates after npm ci: this package is a member of
# the core/web workspace but lives outside it, so Node, Vite and tsc resolving
# upward from here would never reach the workspace's hoisted node_modules.
# It is not committed (a clean checkout would carry a dangling link). No
# trailing slash: a "node_modules/" pattern matches only directories, and the
# link is not one.
node_modules
